# Ownership of the central governance repository.
#
# This repository distributes executable code (prompt-core/rewrite.mjs) into
# every governed repository, where it runs on every prompt submission. A change
# merged here reaches every developer workstation. That makes review of this
# repository a supply-chain control, not a housekeeping preference.
#
# Replace the placeholder team identifiers below with the real teams before
# deployment. Pair this file with branch protection on the default branch:
# required review, required status checks, and no direct pushes.

# Executable code and policy rules — highest sensitivity.
/prompt-core/                        @org/platform-architecture @org/security
/hooks/                              @org/platform-architecture @org/security
/scripts/                            @org/platform-architecture @org/security

# Distributed governance content.
/templates/                          @org/platform-architecture @org/security
/instructions/                       @org/platform-architecture @org/security
/prompts/                            @org/platform-architecture
/evidence/                           @org/platform-architecture @org/security
/tests/                              @org/platform-architecture @org/security

# Distribution scope and automation.
/repos.json                          @org/platform-architecture
/.github/workflows/                  @org/platform-architecture @org/security
/.github/CODEOWNERS                  @org/platform-architecture @org/security
